[{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l005","ordinal":339713,"en":"Having heard all the rumors,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l006","ordinal":339714,"en":"And heard that no strength could prevail"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l007","ordinal":339715,"en":"Against the monstrous infidel’s son,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l008","ordinal":339716,"en":"He showed himself a true lion."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l009","ordinal":339717,"en":"Leaving all others behind,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l010","ordinal":339718,"en":"His long life now drawing late,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l011","ordinal":339719,"en":"He went to meet death at Sarybay’s hands,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l012","ordinal":339720,"en":"To prove he would never retreat,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l013","ordinal":339721,"en":"And test himself against Sarybay."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l014","ordinal":339722,"en":"If his dear eyes closed in death,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l015","ordinal":339723,"en":"He would leave his children and people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l016","ordinal":339724,"en":"Thereafter to the savage enemy,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l017","ordinal":339725,"en":"That vicious swine;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l018","ordinal":339726,"en":"Still, he would test his strength and lion-heart"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l019","ordinal":339727,"en":"Against Sarybay."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l020","ordinal":339728,"en":"He had grieved in life"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l021","ordinal":339729,"en":"And rejoiced when told he would die;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l022","ordinal":339730,"en":"Born of an illustrious man,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l023","ordinal":339731,"en":"Wherever he turned his face,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l024","ordinal":339732,"en":"He carried tumult in his wake."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l025","ordinal":339733,"en":"Descendant of a gray-maned lion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l026","ordinal":339734,"en":"He tore armored coats into four,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l027","ordinal":339735,"en":"And his counterstroke was crimson fire."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l028","ordinal":339736,"en":"He laid low all who opposed him;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l029","ordinal":339737,"en":"None who grappled with him survived."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l030","ordinal":339738,"en":"Whoever provoked his anger,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l031","ordinal":339739,"en":"He drove before him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l032","ordinal":339740,"en":"And crushed between his fangs."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l033","ordinal":339741,"en":"When the enemy met him, whole nations died;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l034","ordinal":339742,"en":"Many giants perished grappling with him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l035","ordinal":339743,"en":"Your true gray-maned lion, your warrior prince,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l036","ordinal":339744,"en":"Raised his steel spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l037","ordinal":339745,"en":"And headed straight toward Sarybay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l038","ordinal":339746,"en":"A naked sword strapped at his side;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l039","ordinal":339747,"en":"As though hail would pour down again,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0599:b003:l040","ordinal":339748,"en":"Wrath spread across his face."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l001","ordinal":339749,"en":"He seemed ready to trample down whoever faced him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l002","ordinal":339750,"en":"His fangs jutting fiercely,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l003","ordinal":339751,"en":"The front of his saddle sagging beneath him."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l004","ordinal":339752,"en":"His majesty appeared supreme,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l005","ordinal":339753,"en":"And any man who watched him"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l006","ordinal":339754,"en":"Was left utterly bewildered."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l007","ordinal":339755,"en":"His courage burned like fire"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l008","ordinal":339756,"en":"As he advanced upon the bloodthirsty lion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l009","ordinal":339757,"en":"Staring about like a devourer,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l010","ordinal":339758,"en":"With all his weapons ready."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l011","ordinal":339759,"en":"Relentless, he transformed in fury,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l012","ordinal":339760,"en":"Raging in savage wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l013","ordinal":339761,"en":"And addressed the bloodthirsty lion:"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l014","ordinal":339762,"en":"“Sarybay, son of the monstrous giant,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l015","ordinal":339763,"en":"If I am the consummate hero of old,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l016","ordinal":339764,"en":"If I am Semetey, son of hero Manas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l017","ordinal":339765,"en":"And you are the foe I have sought,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l018","ordinal":339766,"en":"I will slaughter all who grapple with me;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l019","ordinal":339767,"en":"I will kill and devour them all."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l020","ordinal":339768,"en":"I am the very image of ferocity,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l021","ordinal":339769,"en":"One of those who take men’s lives."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l022","ordinal":339770,"en":"I am the target that steps into the arena,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l023","ordinal":339771,"en":"And I devour every soul that grapples with me."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l024","ordinal":339772,"en":"I am calamity’s black eye,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l025","ordinal":339773,"en":"The blood-drinker himself."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l026","ordinal":339774,"en":"You vain slave who plays the prince,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l027","ordinal":339775,"en":"Today I shall trample your head,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l028","ordinal":339776,"en":"And scatter your four kinds of livestock."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l029","ordinal":339777,"en":"I shall settle your true account"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l030","ordinal":339778,"en":"And utterly sack your people."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l031","ordinal":339779,"en":"I shall seize your mares as plunder"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l032","ordinal":339780,"en":"And bind and capture your giants."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l033","ordinal":339781,"en":"If all my rage is roused,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l034","ordinal":339782,"en":"I shall crush your people"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l035","ordinal":339783,"en":"And trample your broad Ala-Too land"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l036","ordinal":339784,"en":"Flat as a black road."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l037","ordinal":339785,"en":"Stiffened with fury,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l038","ordinal":339786,"en":"I shall slaughter your Kyrgyz people,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l039","ordinal":339787,"en":"Make widows of your women,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b002:l040","ordinal":339788,"en":"And bind your heroes as slaves.”"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l001","ordinal":339789,"en":"His might pierced men to the ribs;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l002","ordinal":339790,"en":"The people saw that he was a giant."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l003","ordinal":339791,"en":"Every mortal who faced him died—"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l004","ordinal":339792,"en":"A peerless champion, a great calamity,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l005","ordinal":339793,"en":"A truly ruthless, ominous heart,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l006","ordinal":339794,"en":"A great calamity born in truth."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l007","ordinal":339795,"en":"When the infidel flew into wrath,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l008","ordinal":339796,"en":"The whole world stood waiting;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l009","ordinal":339797,"en":"O broad black earth with your hairy breast,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l010","ordinal":339798,"en":"Tear through the dense ranks"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l011","ordinal":339799,"en":"Of the swine descending upon your head."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l012","ordinal":339800,"en":"This lion, son of Manas,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l013","ordinal":339801,"en":"Had matured into a hero"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l014","ordinal":339802,"en":"And become the equal of any hero’s son."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l015","ordinal":339803,"en":"He had crossed steel spears,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l016","ordinal":339804,"en":"And warred against men of renown;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l017","ordinal":339805,"en":"He had taken the yellow rolling ridges,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l018","ordinal":339806,"en":"Defeated the khan’s people in battle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l019","ordinal":339807,"en":"Broken through heights and opened roads,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l020","ordinal":339808,"en":"Shaken the world and carried off plunder."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l021","ordinal":339809,"en":"He had surged forth and become a hero,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l022","ordinal":339810,"en":"The equal of any hero’s son."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l023","ordinal":339811,"en":"He wore a thick, bulletproof coat"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l024","ordinal":339812,"en":"And rode bullet-swift Buurul."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l025","ordinal":339813,"en":"He had felled heroes, as the people knew,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l026","ordinal":339814,"en":"Worn his white coat of mail,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l027","ordinal":339815,"en":"Mounted his white-gray steed,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l028","ordinal":339816,"en":"And ruled the people before the nation’s eyes;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l029","ordinal":339817,"en":"Yet he had never seen an infidel like"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l030","ordinal":339818,"en":"Sarybay, the monstrous giant’s son."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l031","ordinal":339819,"en":"He loomed like Ala-Too,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l032","ordinal":339820,"en":"And towered like a craggy peak;"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l033","ordinal":339821,"en":"Dust rose wherever he moved."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l034","ordinal":339822,"en":"When the immovable infidel stirred,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l035","ordinal":339823,"en":"His mere rumbling drove souls from bodies."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l036","ordinal":339824,"en":"No hero dared advance against him,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l037","ordinal":339825,"en":"And none he faced remained alive."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l038","ordinal":339826,"en":"His aspect was one of dreadful torment,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l039","ordinal":339827,"en":"His brows hung like a yurt’s felt covering,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0600:b003:l040","ordinal":339828,"en":"And warriors who saw him seemed ready to flee."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l001","ordinal":339829,"en":"I can't get enough of blood if I drink it,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l002","ordinal":339830,"en":"I didn't give up my life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l003","ordinal":339831,"en":"I am the eye of the slaughterer,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l004","ordinal":339832,"en":"He used to pull the cover,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l005","ordinal":339833,"en":"Black snake myself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l006","ordinal":339834,"en":"I am Sarybay,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l007","ordinal":339835,"en":"The wrestler did not go with a face,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l008","ordinal":339836,"en":"Fight with a spear,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l009","ordinal":339837,"en":"The enemy did not survive,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l010","ordinal":339838,"en":"I have many eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l011","ordinal":339839,"en":"The blue-haired man himself,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l012","ordinal":339840,"en":"Riding on a bulletproof horse,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l013","ordinal":339841,"en":"If my heart opens,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l014","ordinal":339842,"en":"I ate it after disappearing."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l015","ordinal":339843,"en":"The son of Manas is a cucumber,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l016","ordinal":339844,"en":"I came to catch"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l017","ordinal":339845,"en":"Give the wide mountain land,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l018","ordinal":339846,"en":"Give the Kyrgyz people a white hat."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l019","ordinal":339847,"en":"Forgive the female"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l020","ordinal":339848,"en":"Give me a twinkling girl."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l021","ordinal":339849,"en":"Choose from laughter and give it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l022","ordinal":339850,"en":"Give the poor cattle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l023","ordinal":339851,"en":"Give the shepherd soul,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l024","ordinal":339852,"en":"Start with yellow gold and give it to me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l025","ordinal":339853,"en":"Give me a slave,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l026","ordinal":339854,"en":"If you are not used to this,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l027","ordinal":339855,"en":"If you don't say this,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l028","ordinal":339856,"en":"Poison your witness,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l029","ordinal":339857,"en":"That's how I get to the bottom"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l030","ordinal":339858,"en":"My blood flows to your garden,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l031","ordinal":339859,"en":"I greet you with a dark night,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l032","ordinal":339860,"en":"If I do not strengthen your burden,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l033","ordinal":339861,"en":"Don't miss your wife,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l034","ordinal":339862,"en":"I won't leave you alone,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l035","ordinal":339863,"en":"Worn out from winter,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l036","ordinal":339864,"en":"I blushed, I died,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l037","ordinal":339865,"en":"This is how I take my revenge,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l038","ordinal":339866,"en":"Yesterday, your father was at Manas bar."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l039","ordinal":339867,"en":"When he resisted,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b002:l040","ordinal":339868,"en":"The month of the month"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l001","ordinal":339869,"en":"Beating Kakan and making it bleed"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l002","ordinal":339870,"en":"Turn the black road into dust"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l003","ordinal":339871,"en":"Your trembling lips,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l004","ordinal":339872,"en":"I don't listen to you,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l005","ordinal":339873,"en":"If I don't break your back,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l006","ordinal":339874,"en":"I want your breath"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l007","ordinal":339875,"en":"If you are interested,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l008","ordinal":339876,"en":"If it's expensive, burn it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l009","ordinal":339877,"en":"Get used to the saying,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l010","ordinal":339878,"en":"give me whatever you want"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l011","ordinal":339879,"en":"Give up on the female"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l012","ordinal":339880,"en":"Ninety-five women Aichürek,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l013","ordinal":339881,"en":"Start your letter"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l014","ordinal":339882,"en":"Give a hundred girls to shoot,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l015","ordinal":339883,"en":"Ala-Too give a place to draw,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l016","ordinal":339884,"en":"Give the people of the earth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0601:b003:l017","ordinal":339885,"en":"